"description":"Every arrow has a way out. Can you find the order that clears the whole board?\n\nArrow Maze is a clean, strategic puzzle where every tap matters. An arrow can leave only when its path is open. Read the grid, free the right route, and turn a crowded maze into a satisfying clear. Rush and you may lose a life; plan well and your combo keeps climbing.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n• Study the direction of every arrow.\n• Tap a piece only when its route is clear.\n• Remove the right arrows first to open new paths.\n• Clear the board, protect your lives, and earn up to three stars.\n\nMORE THAN ONE WAY TO PLAY\n• Journey through 240 levels across seven evolving worlds.\n• Return for a new Daily Puzzle, keep your streak, and complete three Daily Quests.\n• Slow down with peaceful Zen sessions.\n• With Premium, turn a photo into a playable maze with adjustable detail and silhouette controls.\n• Build combos, collect achievements, and compare scores through Game Center.\n• Choose a visual theme that makes the board feel like yours.\n\nArrow Maze starts simple, then grows into a layered test of planning, pattern recognition, and restraint. Levels are quick to understand, rewarding to replay, and ideal for both short breaks and long puzzle sessions.\n\nOptional weekly and annual Premium subscriptions are available. Current price, duration, and included benefits are shown before purchase. Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled in your Apple Account settings at least 24 hours before the current period ends.\n\nTerms of Use: https://kinapp.dev/arrowmaze/terms/", "bundleId":"zimma.MazeArrows", "userRatingCount":0}]
